      "items": [
        {
          "title": "2025年最佳科学图片",
          "content": "<p>《自然》杂志评选的一组2025年最佳科学图片。</p>\n<p>两只争夺领地的青蛙。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202512/bg2025122507.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>南非废弃天文台长出的蘑菇。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202512/bg2025122508.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "2025年最佳科学图片",
              "url": "https://www.nature.com/immersive/d41586-025-03935-3/index.html"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202512/bg2025122507.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202512/bg2025122508.webp"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "帽子，乌龟和幽灵",
          "content": "<p>2022年，一个业余数学家 David Smith 发现了一个有点像帽子的奇特形状。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202506/bg2025061407.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这个形状的奇特之处在于，它可以无限不重复地铺满整个空间，且不形成周期性的重复图案。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202506/bg2025061409.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>不久后，他又发现了两种稍加变化的形状，称为乌龟和幽灵，也可以不重复地平铺平面。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202506/bg2025061410.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202506/bg2025061411.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>下面就是这三种形状各自平铺的图案。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202506/bg2025061412.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "帽子，乌龟和幽灵",
              "url": "https://www.nhatcher.com/post/on-hats-and-sats/"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202506/bg2025061407.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202506/bg2025061409.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202506/bg2025061410.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202506/bg2025061411.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202506/bg2025061412.webp"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
